@Booking = http://localhost:5101

### List branches
GET {{Booking}}/api/branches
Accept: application/json

### Available slots at branch 1 for the next 7 days
GET {{Booking}}/api/branches/1/slots?days=7
Accept: application/json

### Book a slot (use a slot id from the call above)
POST {{Booking}}/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slotId": 1,
  "citizenId": "9001015009086",
  "serviceType": "PASSPORT"
}

### Book the same slot again: expect 409 Conflict
POST {{Booking}}/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slotId": 1,
  "citizenId": "8502205800086",
  "serviceType": "ID_APPLICATION"
}

### A citizen's appointments
GET {{Booking}}/api/appointments?citizenId=9001015009086
Accept: application/json

### Cancel appointment 1 (the slot becomes free again)
DELETE {{Booking}}/api/appointments/1
